  "body": "**subcategory**\r\nV12.6 SSRF Protection Requirements\r\n\r\n**requirement**\r\n12.6.1 Verify that URL redirects and forwards only allow whitelisted destinations, or show a warning when redirecting to potentially untrusted content.\r\n\r\n**problem**\r\nRequirement 12.6.1 is not limited to Server-Side Request Forger and describes/covers Open Redirect (which is in most cases command to client)\r\n\r\n**recommendation**\r\nFix the mismatch.\r\nAt the moment id does not feel correct but I don't have one-and-only clear recommendation how it should be fixed.\r\nRequirement is not clear SSRF. If to watch it as open redirect (for browser), it does not even belong to V12 category.",
